Z||000000||2xsess||11-30-2000||04:43 PM||||I have a 91 Dodge Spirit that I have to get rid of. We don't use it and I'm tired of paying the insurance. <P>Details: 91 Dodge Spirit Gold exterior,tan interior,140,000miles, just recently had the engine swapped with a 60,000 mile engine,it's a 2.5. Automatic,cold air,inop cruise,tilt,am-fm. I just had the front rotors and pads replaced along with the rear shoes.New O2 sensor, less than 4,000 miles on new tires.<BR>ok here's bad stuff, it's a base model, no power anything. The interior is in dyer need of a good cleaning. The oil pressure on the "new" engine is good but it keeps blowing the oil pan gasket and the oil drips onto the exhaust and causes it to smoke. It's been sitting in the parking lot here for about 2 months and hasn't really been ran. The exterior is in good shape, the rear bumper is slightly faded on the top.<P>I need to get this car out of the parking lot. I'd be willing to drive it a resonable distance but due to the oil leak I'm not really sure what that distance would be.<BR>$500 is the price. I might be able to get pics if anyone is interested. This would be a great beater for anyone that's thinking of taking their Fiero off the road for rebuild or whatever.<P>Help please, I need to get rid of this car soon. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||stimpy||11-30-2000||10:15 PM||||Beaters, we got em!  I also have a beater that is in need of a loving home. My 1988 Mazda 323 GTX is a turbocharged, 16 valve all-wheel drive terror.  It has 99k miles, drivetrain is very smooth. Digital dash, comfy sport bucket seats with 6 way adjustable drivers seat, tilt wheel. Has new struts all around, fairly new Pirelli tires and brakes.<BR>Drove it from CA to OK with no drama, just had starter rebuilt. Recent Interstate battery.<BR>The bad news. Car is a salvage title, expired CA plates. Too much hassle and expense for me to register in OK. Car was damaged in R front, repairs are very amtuerish but effective.  Will sell for best offer. I have 3500 in it, aould like enough to repair my a/c- around $1000.||||reg||1
